    "describe_ch": "屬於世界經濟發展趨勢之實驗榮譽課程，包括授課或小組報告等，協助學生建立全球視野及國際溝通能力，本課程將聚焦解析全球性之經濟趨勢、重大時事及國際生活文化。",
    "describe_eh": "The experimental honors course focuses on global economic development trends, including lectures or group reports etc., which help students build global vision and international communication skills. This course will focus on global economic trends, major current events and international life and culture.",
